# This file is specific to each machine: CPU, kernel modules, firmware.
# It cannot be written in advance.
#
# The disks are described by disko.nix, so it must be generated WITHOUT
# filesystems, from the ISO, once disko has run:
#   nixos-generate-config --no-filesystems --show-hardware-config --root /mnt \
#     > hosts/laptop/hardware-configuration.nix
#
# Until it is replaced, the "laptop" configuration refuses to build.
throw "hosts/laptop/hardware-configuration.nix: replace this file with the one generated by nixos-generate-config --no-filesystems"
